# serializer version: 1
# name: test_initial_n_samples_one_variance[iterative]
  'The statistic V[y] cannot be estimated, as it requires at least 2 samples of y, while the number of samples of y is 1, e.g. because the DOE algorithm generated too few samples of the uncertain variables or because its evaluation failed at some of these samples.'
# ---
# name: test_initial_n_samples_one_variance[standard]
  'The statistic V[y] cannot be estimated, as it requires at least 2 samples of y, while the number of samples of y is 1, e.g. because the DOE algorithm generated too few samples of the uncertain variables or because its evaluation failed at some of these samples.'
